It's finally here! ? My Household Cavalry Artist Residency Exhibition has opened! The Private View looked as good as I could have hoped. Thank you to everyone who came along. This is the manifestation of over 2 years hard work and a surreal timeline of events. It has been the greatest honour to follow the regiment through Covid, The Platinum Jubilee and then The Queen's Funeral.

The Exhibition now runs until 28th October @panterandhall , please visit if you can.

You can see the work by following the link in my bio, nearly all now sold.

